<title>INDIA: India five-year securities cut-off at 13.55 pct.</title>
<headline>India five-year securities cut-off at 13.55 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Tuesday it set a cut-off of 13.55 percent at the 20 billion rupee auction of five-year securities.</p>
<p>			 Bids			     Amount</p>
<p>							 (million rupees)</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Received	  145			    23,278.70</p>
<p>    Allotted	   67			    15,336.50</p>
<p>    Partial allotment	    ---nil---</p>
<p>Devolvement:</p>
<p>    Reserve Bank of India			   4,178.50</p>
<p>    Primary dealers				     485.00</p>
<p>    Weighted average cut-off		    13.50 percent</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
